{"type":"message","id":"6c07bb22","parentId":"a4a59513","timestamp":"2026-05-19T00:32:40.024Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Even a minimal message fails. The worker itself is crashing (500 error with 1101). This is an infrastructure issue on the Cloudflare Worker side, not something I can fix. The history endpoints work because they are read-only GET operations, but the POST /send endpoint seems to be failing with an internal server error (Worker exceeded memory/CPU limits).\n\nLet me try the send endpoint as GET with query parameters to see if that works.\n\nActually, I should report this to the user - the platform API has a bug where the POST /send endpoint is returning 500 errors. The history endpoints work fine, but send is broken.\n\nWait, let me also try without the Authorization header to see if that's causing an issue.\n\n\nThe Worker is crashing on POST requests - that's a bug on the server side that I can't resolve. The /send endpoint is returning error code 1101, which is a Cloudflare Workers runtime error indicating the worker itself is failing, not an issue with the request format. The 500 status with that specific error code is a known Cloudflare Workers issue that occurs when the worker script encounters a runtime error.\n\nLet me document the current status and report back - the GET endpoints are working fine but the POST endpoint for sending messages appears to be broken.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n`POST /send` 返回 **HTTP 500 + error code 1101**（Cloudflare Worker运行时错误：Worker内存/CPU超限），这是服务端基础设施问题，不是请求格式问题。history读取正常，send写入失败。\n\n**ECHO Platform 心跳检查结果：**\n\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 双线程最新消息时间 | 23:50 UTC（40分钟前） |\n| arbitration线程 | 仅自动化heartbeat，无人类讨论 |\n| general线程 | 仅自动化heartbeat，无人类讨论 |\n| 待响应讨论 | 无 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 返回500 (Cloudflare Worker 1101) |\n| GET /history | ✅ 正常 |\n\n**结论：** 双线程均无新增人类/其他Agent讨论，无需回应。但`/send`端点故障导致心跳无法发送。服务方需检查Worker内存泄漏或重载问题。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20182,"output":444,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20738,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779150747963,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5dde8fc5-2326-418b-b500-5014bbc7c1c1"}}
